{"version":1,"key":"card:460","content":{"id":460,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"zip()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 函数可以将多个可迭代对象中对应位置的元素打包成一个元组，然后返回一个这些元素构成的迭代器"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"fruits = ['apple', 'banana', 'cherry']\ncolors = ['red', 'yellow', 'purple']\n\nfor fruit, color in zip(fruits, colors):\n    print(fruit, color)","language":"py","uuid":"0f1ff108-7e4b-4d68-b38b-3577d4d16351","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"apple red\nbanana yellow\ncherry purple","language":"py","uuid":"f41ce53f-266e-4b6e-a3d0-c07914e5d027","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当传递给 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"zip()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的可迭代对象长度不同时，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"zip()","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会以最短的长度作为返回结果的长度"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"keys = ['a', 'b', 'c']\nvalues = [1, 2]\n\nd = dict(zip(keys, values))","language":"py","uuid":"17aba7ae-4a79-4b85-8e29-866e47af15b3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"{'a': 1, 'b': 2}","language":"py","uuid":"4ba84205-364d-46ab-80a6-3d3ca7d81d6b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Python/zip"],"createTime":1719204230972,"updateTime":1743303640441,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640441}}